  <!-- ===== s01 · 原片 0–249 帧（8.30 秒，13 镜）· h3-reference ===== -->
  <text:Value id="p-s01">{
  "subject_definitions": [
    "&lt;Subject 1&gt; is the person in &lt;Picture 1&gt;: the man with a tight topknot, a few wet strands over his forehead, an old scar across his brow bone and a dark indigo, near-black robe with subtle tone-on-tone embroidery.",
    "&lt;Picture 2&gt; shows the same man's full-length costume: near-black robe, leather belt and a long sword in a dark scabbard at his waist.",
    "&lt;Subject 2&gt; are the group in &lt;Picture 3&gt;: the swordsmen in low black woven bamboo hats hiding their eyes, soaked black robes and leather belts, each holding a long sabre.",
    "&lt;Picture 4&gt; shows the location: an ancient courtyard on a rainy night, dark timber corridors and pillars, grey-tiled eaves pouring water, wet reflective stone paving and dim warm lanterns in a cold blue night."
  ],
  "summary": "[reference generation] A 9-second sequence of 13 shots.",
  "retention_analysis": [
    "&lt;Subject 1&gt;: fully_preserved - face, hairstyle and costume are retained.",
    "&lt;Subject 2&gt;: fully_preserved - look, costume and weapons are retained."
  ],
  "detailed_description": "Photorealistic wuxia action film shot on a cinema camera: rainy night, cold blue grade with warm lantern accents, heavy rain and splashing water, fast practical sword fighting with clear contact.\n\n[Shot 1] Shot (00:00.000 - 00:00.900).\n\n[Shot 2] Shot (00:00.900 - 00:01.400).\n\n[Shot 3] Shot (00:01.400 - 00:02.200).\n\n[Shot 4] Shot (00:02.200 - 00:02.933).\n\n[Shot 5] Shot (00:02.933 - 00:03.467).\n\n[Shot 6] Shot (00:03.467 - 00:03.800).\n\n[Shot 7] Shot (00:03.800 - 00:04.267).\n\n[Shot 8] Shot (00:04.267 - 00:04.500).\n\n[Shot 9] Shot (00:04.500 - 00:04.900).\n\n[Shot 10] Shot (00:04.900 - 00:05.367).\n\n[Shot 11] Shot (00:05.367 - 00:05.700).\n\n[Shot 12] Shot (00:05.700 - 00:06.367).\n\n[Shot 13] Shot (00:06.367 - 00:09.000).\n\nNo text, captions, logos or watermarks appear in the picture.",
